    "title": "U.S. Marshals arrest Hope man wanted on rape charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rowdy Baribeau ,\n12 hours ago HOPE, Ark. (KATV) — The U.S. Marshals Service arrested a Hope man who was wanted on rape charges. On June 2, Lance Brewer was taken into custody following an investigation. The investigation began on May 12, when the Hope Police Department obtained an arrest warrant for Brewer. Brewer was charged with one count of rape. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 12",
